+	 * As Apple's display drivers publish it: a dictionary (QuartzCore and VideoToolbox read
+	 * PlaneBaseAlignmentLinear out of it; VideoToolbox's FigGetAlignmentForIOSurfaceOutputToDisplayService sent
+	 * a plain number CFDictionaryGetValue and mediaserverd died building Camera.app's preview). No
